He's had to go live with his granny

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:47.273
and my mom when I've had
to go to Jail and stuff.

00:17:50.824 --> 00:17:52.124
But when he really left me

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.220
for a little while

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:59.290
because he wanted to go
to Dallas with his granny

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:03.623
and try something new, my
addiction really soared.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.193
That's when it got really bad.

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:09.950
He came back.

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:12.830
I'd slowed down a lot,

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:16.130
but he was older.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:19.993
He was bigger than me
and had a lot of anger.

00:18:23.933 --> 00:18:25.283
He wanted to fight me a lot

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:28.423
and I couldn't fight him.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:33.573
So, he's with his dad in Missouri now.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.860
From what I hear, they're doing good.

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:38.290
He's almost 18.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:40.000
He's working.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:43.163
So, that makes me really happy.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.260
Wherever my kids are,

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:50.760
as long as they're safe
and happy and protected,

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.303
that's what matters to me.

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:56.820
I'll sacrifice my feelings

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:01.820
in my heart so that they're
safe and well taken care of.

00:19:05.511 --> 00:19:06.983
- [Mark] What's your biggest regret?

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:15.193
- My biggest regret was,
going to see doctor,

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:21.973
and getting on pain medicine.

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:27.630
Because before that, I
really didn't do drugs.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.230
I didn't even smoke a cigarette.

00:19:32.205 --> 00:19:33.710
And when I got on those
pain pills prescription

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.870
I thought prescription and they are okay.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.860
He wrote me, he was a script writer.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:42.420
He wrote me a,

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:43.253
Opana..

00:19:43.253 --> 00:19:44.910
I don't know if you know what that is.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.070
It's oxymorphone.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:47.793
They give it to, to dying people.

00:19:49.115 --> 00:19:54.115
Percocet, Lortab, Cenex,
Valium, Fentanyl. .

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:56.080
I get all that a month.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:56.983
In one month.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:58.653
And

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.850
that's my biggest regret.

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:04.460
I feel like if I never went to him that

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:06.020
I never would've

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.390
gotten a pill addiction.

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.393
And that's what started it.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:15.650
'Cause once you're addicted to pills,

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.193
your body becomes dependent.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:19.820
And so...

00:20:21.489 --> 00:20:23.250
- [Mark] What's been the most

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.070
important lesson you've learned?

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:36.220
- This way of life, drugs,

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:37.243
all of this,

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.270
nobody's above it.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:43.160
It can happen to anybody.

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.603
The best of us, the smartest of us.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.373
It happens very quickly.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.343
And that's,

00:21:01.854 --> 00:21:03.423
I guess that's it that.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:08.380
Nobody's immune to it. Nobody.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:10.823
You get an addiction, your morals change.

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:17.380
And until rape is a normal
part of your life. (chuckling)

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:23.203
- [Mark] All right, Jayme.

00:21:23.203 --> 00:21:25.213
Thank you so much for sharing your story.

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:28.103
- [Jayme] You're welcome.

00:21:28.103 --> 00:21:29.220
- [Mark] I wish you the
best of luck with...

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:30.873
- [Jayme] Thank you.

00:21:30.873 --> 00:21:32.990
- [Mark] Getting out of this street life.

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:33.823
- [Jayme] Thank you.

00:21:33.823 --> 00:21:35.145
- [Mark] And addiction.

00:21:35.145 --> 00:21:36.812
- [Jayme] Thank you.

